Package: muiPersonalWebsite
Title: Personal Site Generator Using 'muiMaterial'
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Félix", "Luginbühl", , "felix.luginbuhl@protonmail.ch", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Builds a personal website from YAML alone. Every element of every
    page is a 'muiMaterial' component, from the app bar to the footer, with the
    'head' metadata written at build time. A configuration file names the sections;
    each section is a content file of projects, apps or talks; and
    mui_create_site() writes a working site to start from. It is the generator
    behind felixluginbuhl.com, and the functions themselves double as worked
    examples of 'muiMaterial' in production.
